      {
        "name": "lag-membership-unread",
        "source": "dudarchy-05j; docs/recon/edgeos.md (physical-pair finding): SwOS v2.13 exposes no IEEE8023-LAG-MIB and no ifStackTable, all 26 ports are ifType 6, and no bond interface exists; LACP membership is configuration-only"
      }
    ]
